      "bsm_3": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "lower_third",
        "text": "SOLENNE RESIDENCES, FLOOR THIRTY",
        "subtext": "LATE, AND GETTING LATER",
        "graphic_id": "",
        "duration_s": 6,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 80
        },
        "next": "bsm_4"
      },
      "bsm_4": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "The city turns past the glass like something on a spit. Rain, but expensive rain.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 80
        },
        "next": "bsm_5"
      },
      "bsm_5": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 240
        },
        "next": "bsm_6"
      },
      "bsm_6": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "act_card",
        "text": "ACT 1",
        "subtext": "Previously, On Hard Wired",
        "duration_s": 8,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 240
        },
        "next": "bsm_7"
      },
      "bsm_7": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Previously: Cruz fixed the boiler. Then he fixed the OTHER boiler. Then Greta died in a",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 240
        },
        "next": "bsm_8"
      },
      "bsm_8": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "freight elevator, which we are contractually obliged to remind you was NOT Cruz's fault.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 240
        },
        "next": "bsm_9"
      },
      "bsm_9": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Also, there was a war. It was mostly off-screen. Budget.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 240
        },
        "next": "bsm_10"
      },
      "bsm_10": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 4,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_11"
      },
      "bsm_11": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "A doorbell chimes in a key chosen by a committee. DELPHINE VOSS crosses forty feet of\napartment in a robe that cost more than the door.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_12"
      },
      "bsm_12": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Who is it.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_13"
      },
      "bsm_13": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"Building maintenance, ma'am. I'm here about your pressure.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_14"
      },
      "bsm_14": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"My what.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_15"
      },
      "bsm_15": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"Your water pressure.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_16"
      },
      "bsm_16": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"...Yes. Of course. That.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_17"
      },
      "bsm_17": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_18"
      },
      "bsm_18": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "She opens the door. CRUZ MANDIBLE stands there holding a wrench the size of an argument.\nHe is wet. It is not raining in the corridor. Nobody addresses this.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_19"
      },
      "bsm_19": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"I understand there's been some trouble with the flow.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_20"
      },
      "bsm_20": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"It comes on strong and then it just... stops.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 720
        },
        "next": "bsm_21"
      },
      "bsm_21": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"That's a common fault in a unit this old.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 720
        },
        "next": "bsm_22"
      },
      "bsm_22": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"The unit is four years old.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 720
        },
        "next": "bsm_23"
      },
      "bsm_23": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"Then it's a common fault in a unit this new.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 720
        },
        "next": "bsm_24"
      },
      "bsm_24": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 2,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 720
        },
        "next": "bsm_25"
      },
      "bsm_25": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "CRUZ kneels at the wall panel. His overalls do the thing overalls do in this genre. The\ncamera holds on it for eleven seconds, which is four seconds longer than the director\nremembers approving.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_26"
      },
      "bsm_26": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 4,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_27"
      },
      "bsm_27": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Will you have to go deep?\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_28"
      },
      "bsm_28": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"Ma'am, I always go deep. It's in the manual.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_29"
      },
      "bsm_29": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "The Building says, \"RESIDENT ADVISORY. AN UNSCHEDULED MAINTENANCE EVENT IS OCCURRING IN YOUR UNIT.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_30"
      },
      "bsm_30": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Not now, building.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "next": "bsm_31"
      },
      "bsm_31": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "The Building says, \"PLEASE RATE YOUR MAINTENANCE EVENT FROM ONE TO FIVE STARS.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "next": "bsm_32"
      },
      "bsm_32": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"I said NOT NOW, building.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "next": "bsm_33"
      },
      "bsm_33": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "next": "bsm_34"
      },
      "bsm_34": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "act_card",
        "text": "ACT 2",
        "subtext": "The Ductwork",
        "duration_s": 8,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "next": "bsm_35"
      },
      "bsm_35": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "text_card",
        "text": "BITTERSWEET OPTICS PRESENTS\n\nA FILM SHOT ENTIRELY IN ONE APARTMENT\n\nBECAUSE WE ONLY HAD THE ONE APARTMENT",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "next": "bsm_36"
      },
      "bsm_36": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "next": "bsm_37"
      },
      "bsm_37": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "CRUZ removes a grille. Steam rolls out of the duct in a great voluptuous cloud, because\nthe effects department owned exactly one machine and had been saving it.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "next": "bsm_38"
      },
      "bsm_38": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"Whoever installed this ran the hot line straight into the cold return. Cross-connected.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "next": "bsm_39"
      },
      "bsm_39": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Everything's been touching everything for years.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "next": "bsm_40"
      },
      "bsm_40": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"In this building? Scandalous.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_41"
      },
      "bsm_41": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"I'll need to get my hands on the coupling.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_42"
      },
      "bsm_42": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Do you need help?\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_43"
      },
      "bsm_43": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"I'd never turn down another pair of hands.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_44"
      },
      "bsm_44": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_45"
      },
      "bsm_45": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "They both reach into the wall. Their fingers meet somewhere in the dark on a fitting neither\nof them can see. There is a long, meaningful silence. Somewhere, a pipe groans.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_46"
      },
      "bsm_46": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Is that —\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_47"
      },
      "bsm_47": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"That's the ballcock.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_48"
      },
      "bsm_48": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"The what?\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_49"
      },
      "bsm_49": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"It's a technical term. It regulates the rise.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_50"
      },
      "bsm_50": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Of course it does.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1680
        },
        "next": "bsm_51"
      },
      "bsm_51": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 4,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1680
        },
        "next": "bsm_52"
      },
      "bsm_52": {
        "type": "music",
        "song": "",
        "text": "A saxophone begins, uninvited, from somewhere below the floor. It will not stop for the\nremainder of the picture. The composer was paid in full.",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1680
        },
        "next": "bsm_53"
      },
      "bsm_53": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "DELPHINE lets the robe slip from one shoulder, which is as far as it gets, because the\nshoulder is where our exhibition licence expires.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1680
        },
        "next": "bsm_54"
      },
      "bsm_54": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "fade",
        "fade": "out",
        "text": "",
        "duration_s": 3,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1680
        },
        "next": "bsm_55"
      },
      "bsm_55": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "What follows is forty minutes of the most explicit, most athletically ill-advised plumbing",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1840
        },
        "next": "bsm_56"
      },
      "bsm_56": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "in the history of the Basin. We are legally unable to show you any of it.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1840
        },
        "next": "bsm_57"
      },
      "bsm_57": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Instead, please enjoy this exterior shot of the building.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1840
        },
        "next": "bsm_58"
      },
      "bsm_58": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 6,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1840
        },
        "next": "bsm_59"
      },
      "bsm_59": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "An exterior shot of the building. Nothing happens. A light in one window goes out. Another\ngoes on. A third window, unrelated, is simply a window.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1840
        },
        "next": "bsm_60"
      },
      "bsm_60": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 6,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 2000
        },
        "next": "bsm_61"
      },
      "bsm_61": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Still the exterior of the building. A bird lands. The bird leaves. The saxophone continues\nwithout visible support.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 2000
        },
        "next": "bsm_62"
      },
      "bsm_62": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 5,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 2000
        },
        "next": "bsm_63"
      },
      "bsm_63": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "intermission",
        "text": "INTERMISSION",
        "subtext": "",
        "duration_s": 20,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 2000
        },
        "next": "bsm_64"
      },
      "bsm_64": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "fade",
        "fade": "in",
        "text": "",
        "duration_s": 2,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 2000
        },
        "next": "bsm_65"
      },
      "bsm_65": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "act_card",
        "text": "ACT 3",
        "subtext": "Complications",
        "duration_s": 8,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 2160
        },
        "next": "bsm_66"
      },
      "bsm_66": {
        "type": "overlay",
        "overlayType": "lower_third",
        "text": "THE SAME APARTMENT",
        "subtext": "FORTY MINUTES OF PLUMBING LATER",
        "graphic_id": "",
        "duration_s": 6,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 2160
        },
        "next": "bsm_67"
      },
      "bsm_67": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "CRUZ lies on the floor among his tools, spent, glowing, holding a length of copper pipe he\nhas plainly bent by hand. DELPHINE stands at the glass. Something enormous has been resolved.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 2160
        },
        "next": "bsm_68"
      },
      "bsm_68": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"That was... comprehensive.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 2160
        },
        "next": "bsm_69"
      },
      "bsm_69": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"I'll send the invoice.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 2160
        },
        "next": "bsm_70"
      },
      "bsm_70": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Send it slowly.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 2320
        },
        "next": "bsm_71"
      },
      "bsm_71": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 2320
        },
        "next": "bsm_72"
      },
      "bsm_72": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "The door opens. GRETA VOSS-VOSS stands in it. She is dressed for a funeral. Her own, as it\nhappens. She was buried in this.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 2320
        },
        "next": "bsm_73"
      },
      "bsm_73": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Greta Voss-Voss says, \"Hello, sister.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 2320
        },
        "next": "bsm_74"
      },
      "bsm_74": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Greta! You're — you were in the elevator —\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 2320
        },
        "next": "bsm_75"
      },
      "bsm_75": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Greta Voss-Voss says, \"I got out at a different floor.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 2480
        },
        "next": "bsm_76"
      },
      "bsm_76": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"That's not how elevators —\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 2480
        },
        "next": "bsm_77"
      },
      "bsm_77": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Greta Voss-Voss says, \"It's how THAT one works, Cruz.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 2480
        },
        "next": "bsm_78"
      },
      "bsm_78": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 4,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 2480
        },
        "next": "bsm_79"
      },
      "bsm_79": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Delphine Voss says, \"Why are you here?\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 2480
        },
        "next": "bsm_80"
      },
      "bsm_80": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Greta Voss-Voss says, \"Because the pressure's off in MY unit too.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 2640
        },
        "next": "bsm_81"
      },
      "bsm_81": {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3,
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 2640
        },
        "next": "bsm_82"
      },
      "bsm_82": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "CRUZ slowly sits up. He looks at his wrench. He looks at the two women. He looks at the\nceiling, where the building is definitely listening. He is a professional, and this is a\nservice call, and there is a form for this.",
        "style": "narration",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 2640
        },
        "next": "bsm_83"
      },
      "bsm_83": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "Cruz Mandible says, \"...I'll have to see the manifold.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 2640
        },
        "next": "bsm_84"
      },
      "bsm_84": {
        "type": "say",
        "text": "The Building says, \"RESIDENT ADVISORY. AN UNSCHEDULED MAINTENANCE EVENT IS OCCURRING IN YOUR UNIT.\"",
        "style": "verbatim",
